# An escort level's exit walk (PlayerEscortExit, $81:E730). Level $12
# (stage a6 s0) ends when the camera passes its exit spot (x $1EF0, the
# table at $80:B96B marks it): LevelExitCheck then sets the player's code
# to $E730. No script's play reaches the level's far end, so the camera's
# scroll x ($1773) is put just short of the spot and Aladdin, on his
# carpet, 192 pixels right of it (on screen, where play can have him);
# the original's own frame then finds the exit, he walks out, his x is
# held at $2060 during the fade, and LevelEndTask takes over.
load build/aladdin/states/stage_a6_s0.state
wait 2
poke $001773 F0,1E
poke $0008E7 B0,1F
wait 1
wait 30
wait 30
wait 400
